{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ever wondered how your grocery store deliveries are collected and packed? We have an answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Critter Cart</strong> comes from the desire to race shopping carts around grocery stores. This game features various maps and customization of cart, critter and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drift and boost around each map as you are given procedural checkpoints and must make your own path to complete the race as fast as possible, collecting checkpoints with the highest score possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601300/extras/Gif03-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter__3_.gif?t=1751353195\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customisation</strong>, choose various creatures to race around as. Hats, steering wheels, cart panels can all be unlocked and changed.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedural generation</strong>, each map is a set layout, but placement of checkpoints, hazards, and pick ups are different to ensuring as much replayability as possible.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The most important feature, <strong>Multiplayer</strong>, race around with up to 7 other critters as you compete to see who can get the best time, or the highest score.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601300/extras/Gif02-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter__1_.gif?t=1751353195\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demo out now. Release date set for Late June.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601300?t=1751353195","backgrou